    "created_at": "2018-04-10T21:10:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-10T21:10:24Z",
    "body": "If this only is the response URL I would request exposing a way to get the full URL. What is the reason to not include the fragment? It seems weird that we execute multiple times but are unable to determine the fragment and therefore cache entry to bust that the execution is tied to.",
